      "id": "claim_2c280c21ab08438e8b90ba869e38ee6f",
      "statement": "The consents gate uses a global signal `consentsBlocked` in `src/app/consents.ts` that is raised on any `451` response from the service and passed to `provideRhAuth` as `config.onError` during bootstrap.",
