    {
      "id": "claim_bf9b2f0192834c23a57b67286fde71a7",
      "statement": "The `ulabase.setup.ts` script provides declarative setup for the accounts plugin: installs the plugin, configures feature flags derived from `environment.dev.ts`, sets Google OAuth credentials if enabled, and adds the app origin to the CORS allowlist.",
